            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.18.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rev 18.2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“And so Babylon will be haunted by demons and evil spirits,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50.39",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "demons and evil spirits",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "wildcats and jackals.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " and by unclean birds. Never again will people live there, not for all time to come. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.19.24+GEN.19.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gen 19.24–25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The same thing will happen to Babylon as happened to Sodom and Gomorrah, when I destroyed them and the nearby towns. No one will ever live there again. I, the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", have spoken.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Like a lion coming out of the thick woods along the Jordan up to the green pasture land, I, the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", will come and make the Babylonians run away suddenly from their city. Then the leader I choose will rule the nation. Who can be compared to me? Who would dare challenge me? What ruler could oppose me? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So listen to the plan that I have made against the city of Babylon and to what I intend to do to its people. Even their children will be dragged off, and everyone will be horrified. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When Babylon falls, there will be such a noise that the entire earth will shake, and the cries of alarm will be heard by the other nations.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.46"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
